Light Show Anywhere

Third-party code
================

web/src/party/clock.ts is a TypeScript port of public/clocksync.js from Crowd Light Show
(https://github.com/AndriiShramko/crowd-light-show), licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(see licenses/Apache-2.0.txt). Changes: rewritten as a TypeScript class, the ping loop and
background-tab handling moved into startClockSync(), and telemetry fields removed.

