Libraries
=========

Video export uses Mediabunny (https://github.com/Vanilagy/mediabunny), unmodified, under the
Mozilla Public License 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/); its source is available there and in
the npm package.

Facts, not code
===============

The Tesla channel map and command meanings follow Tesla's public documentation and xLights
template (https://github.com/teslamotors/light-show). No Tesla files are included.
LightCue (https://github.com/wmorrill3/lightcue, MIT) was used only as a cross-check.
